null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.998851158789226}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [49.06931762695312, 254.637109375, 542.300537109375, 285.1935546875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9989627904362148}], "snippet": "第五条提交期限\n\n报销期限为费用发生后15个自然日。本文未说明适用部门，也未说明是否替代其他报销制度。自然日包括周末和节假日，申请人不应自行改为工作日口径。申请材料应如实列明费用发生日期及提交日期。\n\n本资料未定义首日是否计入、截止时刻以及节假日顺延。若用户要求计算精确的最迟提交日，应先确认这些口径；本文只能支持“费用发生后15个自然日”的原则性表述，不能支", "rrf_score": 0.031746, "bm25_score": 3.681846, "vector_score": 0.482406}, {"doc_id": "D04", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c043", "title": "出差住宿规则", "topic": "住宿", "scope": "国内出差", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r043", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["出差住宿规则", "第六条 订单变化与退款"], "token_count": 228, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 6, "bbox": [48.0, 323.1171875, 168.75, 334.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 6, "bbox": [48.0, 349.9765625, 541.5, 377.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 6, "bbox": [48.0, 393.9765625, 541.5, 439.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第六条 订单变化与退款\n\n行程变更导致取消、改期、提前离店或延住时，应保留原订单与变更记录，说明实际入住情况及退款金额。退款后不得按原订单全额报销；产生取消费时，应说明原因并请求确认，本文不规定取消费自动可报。\n\n个人旅游延住不能在申请中隐去，业务住宿与个人住宿应分别说明。同行人员分别付款或一人代付时，应保留参与关系及分摊说明，防止同一晚住宿重复申报。本文未", "rrf_score": 0.03031, "bm25_score": 3.365854, "vector_score": 0.462485}, {"doc_id": "D04", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c017", "title": "出差住宿规则", "topic": "住宿", "scope": "国内出差", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r017", "related_ids": ["r005", "r038", "r039", "r040", "r041"], "heading_path": ["出差住宿规则", "表A"], "token_count": 101, "kind": "table_row", "table_id": "table01", "row_id": "T12", "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_table", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 371.5, 96.0, 402.0], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_table", "page": 3, "bbox": [96.0, 371.5, 148.0, 402.0], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_table", "page": 3, "bbox": [148.0, 371.5, 209.0, 402.0], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_table", "page": 3, "bbox": [209.0, 371.5, 245.0, 402.0], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_table", "page": 3, "bbox": [245.0, 371.5, 547.0, 402.0], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "T12 | 西安 | 国内出差 | 350 | 取消后重新预订应保留关联订单；本文未规定取消费自动可以报销。", "rrf_score": 0.030118, "bm25_score": 3.380511, "vector_score": 0.46103}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c011", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r011", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十一条撤销与退款"], "token_count": 200, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 427.365966796875, 157.36021728515624, 440.097802734375], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9987809724277921}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.22329406738281, 452.4052734375, 541.8775390625, 501.635107421875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9992374968021474}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 3, "bbox": [49.06931762695312, 514.366943359375, 541.8775390625, 544.4990234375], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9992364913225174}], "snippet": "第十一条撤销与退款\n\n发现重复申请、业务取消或金额填错时，应及时通过原流程撤销或变更，并保留原单号。审核通过后发生退款的，应将退款时间、金额和对应订单提交财务确认。是否需要追回已支付费用以及具体方式，需另有处理依据。\n\n同一支出不得由代付人和实际参与人员分别全额申报。申请人不能把撤销后的相同费用再次提交而不说明关联关系，避免审核人员误判为两笔独立支出。", "rrf_score": 0.029236, "bm25_score": 2.36472, "vector_score": 0.465181}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c008", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r008", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第八节 结束使用"], "token_count": 125, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 547.6171875, 134.25, 559.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 574.4765625, 541.5, 602.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第八节 结束使用\n\n完成远程工作后，应按客户端提供的方式断开连接，确认不再需要访问内部资源。不要把长期保持连接当成获得持续授权的证明。本文未规定自动断开时长或并发设备数量，这些限制需要查询具体服务配置。", "rrf_score": 0.028778, "bm25_score": 2.502931, "vector_score": 0.458986}]}}
